  "solution": "Given equation: 13 + 145 ÷ 29 × 52 – 11 = 106\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) – and × \n\nGiven: 13 + 145 ÷ 29 × 52 – 11 = 106\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 13 + __**145 ÷ 29**__ - 52 × 11 = 106\n\n⇒ 13 + 5 - __**52 × 11**__ = 106\n\n⇒ __**13 + 5**__ - 572 = 106\n\n⇒ __18 - 572__ = 106\n\n⇒ -554 ≠ 106\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) × ****and +**\n\nGiven: 13 + 145 ÷ 29 × 52 – 11 = 106\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 13 × __**145 ÷ 29**__ + 52 – 11 = 106\n\n⇒ __**13 × 5**__ + 52 – 11 = 106\n\n⇒ __**6**____**5 + 52**__ – 11 = 106\n\n⇒ __117 - 11__ = 106\n\n⇒ **106 = 106**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) ÷ and –\n\nGiven: 13 + 145 ÷ 29 × 52 – 11 = 106\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 13 + 145 - 29 × __**52 ÷ 11**__ = 106\n\n⇒ 13 + 145 - __**29 × 4.72**__ = 106\n\n⇒ __**13 + 145**__ - 136.88 = 106\n\n⇒ __158____ - 136.88__ = 106\n\n⇒ 21.12 ≠ 106\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷ and +\n\nGiven: 13 + 145 ÷ 29 × 52 – 11 = 106\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**13 ÷ 145**__ + 29 × 52 – 11 = 106\n\n⇒ 0.09 + __**29 × 52**__ – 11 = 106\n\n⇒ __**0.09 + 1508**__ – 11 = 106\n\n⇒ __1508.09 - 11__ = 106\n\n⇒ 1497.09 ≠ 106\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
